  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "祈禱"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳俐雯</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit年　愛kah山盟海誓</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">現時　只賰心酸纏tòe</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hiàng時</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">絲絲誓言　ù心頭</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chit-má</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">手指退色　剝bē lut&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">情影切kah一塊仔一塊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">掠bē著閃爍ê記持</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無情ê反hiau sńg-tn̄g青春</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">苦澀ê靈魂tī鐵窗內滾絞</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">揣無步thang tháu放ê怨</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ng-chn̂g soan íⁿ cha̍t tī泉頭</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hō͘心沓沓仔拍kat</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">愛　聊聊仔死--去</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無愛看顧ê花欉</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">驚　ná hùn ná闊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心　ná沉ná深</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tâm濕濕ê目墘揣無phàng見ê幸福</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">檢采是神ê疼thàng</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">引chhōa ǹg望鑽過pit巡ê空喙</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心liòng開禁聲ê束縛</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">奮力吐出憂鬱　大聲向天祈禱</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">願光降臨　願愛kap我做伙</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就算賰上尾仔一口khùi絲</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mā beh走揣藏tī手面ê春天</span></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdLUuWo761xZIWAPJHIIcewuvUzbNOMYSyUFgHedLnpoo_4coCcfIkmqbJoymTQ4kN5LxonlgUSD0CEZLudEwvRO0-aL2kNrRSq3b8jmNLLflGHLR_q-NhApA02Y7-tI8D0ekhIcbfP67L-8hFgO5pxZ_t4bsUlUKUzR6LeEbnuo833lsslfuY4f_ydw/s1421/340%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdLUuWo761xZIWAPJHIIcewuvUzbNOMYSyUFgHedLnpoo_4coCcfIkmqbJoymTQ4kN5LxonlgUSD0CEZLudEwvRO0-aL2kNrRSq3b8jmNLLflGHLR_q-NhApA02Y7-tI8D0ekhIcbfP67L-8hFgO5pxZ_t4bsUlUKUzR6LeEbnuo833lsslfuY4f_ydw/w450-h640/340%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgiZHrOc6B56YHyFOYObZnHYP73NkfXSMvX7fi3M7mQGJNVevC0E_bBTpqL80UBEX7YWsDTE23T9mUBmaUto91Es_vso3R3NqUTtuhC-m9abbhRV_kHdDre_9oXBwQzDEPNHN18gAJMSKcokP_nBHshJj8xA_MyXMLgH1KZj7jiUU8cS4oQS6YmoowgGA/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1340%E6%9C%9F_034.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgiZHrOc6B56YHyFOYObZnHYP73NkfXSMvX7fi3M7mQGJNVevC0E_bBTpqL80UBEX7YWsDTE23T9mUBmaUto91Es_vso3R3NqUTtuhC-m9abbhRV_kHdDre_9oXBwQzDEPNHN18gAJMSK